{
  "schema": "elder-souls/topics@1",
  "group": "race-gated",
  "owner": "W1-07 — race and standing",
  "source": "corpus/22-character/RI-CHR02-race-and-standing.md §4c: '>= 90 race-filtered topic records, >= 30 of them forbids'. Round 1 shipped 0 of each.",
  "note": "A `requires.race` info is one only that race is offered; a `forbids.race` info is one that race is NEVER offered, which is the harder and more interesting half — it is the town declining to say a thing in front of you. Every line is written to be said aloud by the speaker class named in `a`.",
  "topics": [
    {
      "id": "the-hatching-pool",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "The pool you came out of is still there and it is smaller than you remember. They all are. Nobody moved it; you got bigger and the water did not.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "your-egg-year",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "Egg-year matters for two things: who you may not marry, and who has to carry you home when you are old. Warmbloods think it is a birthday.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-sap-says",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "Sap does not say. Sap shows, and then you spend a season deciding what it showed. Anyone who tells you the Hist spoke to them in sentences is selling something.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-name",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "Everyone has one. Almost nobody uses it. It is the one your egg-clutch called you before the Office wrote a shorter one down.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "root-water",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "It is not a drink. It is the tree agreeing to be in the same room as you for a while.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-drowned-kin",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "fisher",
          "x": "We do not say they died. We say the water kept them, which is a different thing to have to explain to a warmblood.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "standing-in-the-shallows",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "fisher",
          "x": "You will have done it as a hatchling without being taught. Nobody teaches it. That is the point of it.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-marsh-fever",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "healer",
          "x": "It goes through the villages every second summer and it takes the very old and the very new and leaves the rest of us tired for a year.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-old-tongue",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "archivist",
          "x": "Jel is not a code. Jel is a language whose grammar has tenses for things that have not decided whether they happened.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "counting-by-tides",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "fisher",
          "x": "Two tides is a day. Nobody outside the marsh accepts this and nobody inside it accepts anything else.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-warmbloods-ask",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "They ask whether we lay eggs, whether we can breathe water, and whether we are cold. In that order. Always in that order.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-village-that-moved",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "The whole of it, boards and roofs and the shrine, four hundred paces west, because the water asked. Took a season. Nobody argued.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "your-clutch-mark",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "On the inside of the arm, where you cannot see it without turning your wrist over, which is deliberate.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-molt",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "healer",
          "x": "It is worse than they tell you and then it is over and then you are somebody slightly different.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hist-debt",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "You owe the tree nothing. That is what makes it a tree and not a House.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-river-bands",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "naga-elder",
          "x": "Nine bands on this river. Six will feed you. Two will take your boat. One will do both and be offended if you mention it.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-towns-say-about-us",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "naga-elder",
          "x": "That we eat people. We do not, mostly, and the mostly is doing more work than anybody is comfortable with.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-long-swim",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "naga-elder",
          "x": "Mouth to headwater in one go. It is not a rite. It is just something that has happened to most of us by thirty.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bank-law",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "naga-elder",
          "x": "Below the waterline is ours. Above it is an argument. That is the whole of the law and it has held for six hundred years.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-person",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "naga-elder",
          "x": "They speak about us while we are standing there. We have stopped correcting it. It is useful to be furniture.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "house-business",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "You will know the shape of it. Three Houses trade here and one of them owns the road you came in on.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-factor-house",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "Back room, second bell. Bring nothing in writing and take nothing out in writing.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-we-are-owed",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "The Arnesian War is a hundred and twenty years old and the ledgers from it are still open, which tells you what kind of House keeps them.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-wine",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "Comes up from Tear by boat and tastes of the boat. Drink it anyway; refusing is a statement.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "your-people-here",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "town-elder",
          "x": "There are eleven of you in this town and nine of them keep very quiet, and I do not think you are one of the nine.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-word-they-use",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "Ash-man. They will say it to your face and mean nothing by it, and then somebody will say it and mean everything by it, and you will not be able to tell which until after.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-surcharge",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "merchant",
          "x": "You noticed. Everyone notices. There is a man in Helstrom who can have it struck off, once, for a piece of work nobody else will do.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-marsh-remembers",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "It remembers your grandfather's House and not your grandfather. It is not personal. Nothing this old is personal.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cohort-business",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "Ninth Cohort, and if you are going to ask about the pay, the answer is in Sun's Height and the year is not this one.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-muster-board",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "Four hundred names. Two hundred and six of them are men. The rest is establishment.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-provincial-office",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "clerk",
          "x": "It exists to be the reason a thing cannot be done today. That is not cynicism, that is its charter.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "citizenship",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "clerk",
          "x": "You have it. Nobody here does, technically, and everybody here is subject to it, which is the arrangement.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-tribune-wants",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "To retire in Anvil. He has wanted it for eleven years and the wanting is the only thing keeping him at the post.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "home-leave",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "Two men in the cohort have had it. One came back. We do not discuss the other one and it is not what you are thinking.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "breathing-here",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "healer",
          "x": "The air is water with opinions. Give it a fortnight. If you are still coughing after a fortnight, it is not the air.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-to-drink",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "innkeeper",
          "x": "Not the water. Not the beer either, but at least the beer is honest about it.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-boards",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "Stay on them. Everything under them is either water or something in the water and you will not enjoy learning which.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "warmblood",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "It is not an insult. It is a fact about your blood and they are a very literal people about facts.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-fever",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "healer",
          "x": "You will get it. Everyone from outside gets it. It is survivable and it is not pleasant and it comes back.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "why-anyone-comes-here",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "innkeeper",
          "x": "Debt, a warrant, or a posting. Occasionally love, and that one ends worst.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-smell",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "innkeeper",
          "x": "Four days. Then you stop noticing and start smelling of it, which is the same thing from the outside.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "boots",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "merchant",
          "x": "Buy the local ones. Yours will rot off at the seam in a month and you will walk home barefoot and educated.",
          "requires": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-net-price",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "Forty a head at the road, eighty at the coast, and the difference is the risk of the road.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "who-buys",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "Plantations south, and two names in Helstrom I will not say out loud.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-quiet-route",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "smuggler",
          "x": "Up the second channel, past the drowned stones, and you never saw me.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-tribune-drinks",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "Every night since the summer and twice on muster days.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-cohort-sells",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "Grain, mostly. Some of it ours. Some of it not ours yet.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-lukiul-problem",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "deep-elder",
          "x": "They come back with the coast in their mouths and they want the village to be the way they described it to somebody.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "about-the-naga",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "fisher",
          "x": "We do not go past the second bend. Nobody goes past the second bend.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-shadowscale-list",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "rootkeeper",
          "x": "There is a list and it is kept where the Office cannot read it, and if your name is on it you were not asked.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-the-house-pays-us",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "town-elder",
          "x": "Enough that the town has stopped asking where the wagons go.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga",
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-arrangement",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "clerk",
          "x": "Two writs a month go out unstamped and one comes back with a different name on it.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-fence-at-helstrom",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "outlaw",
          "x": "Second cellar off the fish market, and he will not see you if you have a Legion walk.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-warden-scribes-file",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "clerk",
          "x": "She keeps one that is not the Office's. I have seen the box and I have not seen inside it.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-happens-to-the-old-ones",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "dres-factor",
          "x": "They stop being an asset and start being a cost, and the House is very good at costs.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "saxhleel",
              "naga"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "our-losses",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "legionary",
          "x": "Eleven this season and nine of them to fever, which is not a number I put on the return.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-second-ledger",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "merchant",
          "x": "One for the Office and one for the truth, and I will show you neither.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-bank-toll",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "naga-elder",
          "x": "We take a third off anything with a House mark on it and nothing off a village boat.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "who-informs",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "outlaw",
          "x": "Somebody in the square does. We have narrowed it to four and we are being patient.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-thing-in-the-cistern",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "villager",
          "x": "It was here before the town and the town was built around not mentioning it.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
              "redguard",
              "khajiit",
              "orsimer",
              "bosmer"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-we-do-with-the-writs",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "outlaw",
          "x": "Soak, scrape, re-ink. Four days and you are somebody with a clean road.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "imperial"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-drowned-road",
      "infos": [
        {
          "a": "vakh-speaker",
          "x": "It is walkable at the low tide of the third day and it does not want warmbloods on it.",
          "forbids": {
            "race": [
              "dunmer",
              "imperial",
              "nord",
              "breton",
